# THE BUILD CONTEXT IS THE SOURCE AND NOTHING ELSE (no secret in any layer:
# no key, no origin, no token baked). Everything is kept out by the first
# line, then the source let back in. Among what the first line keeps out:
# target/ (the build artifacts), .git/, .idea/, fuzz/ (the nightly corpus),
# conformance/ (the goldens), the documents, and any board*/ or store*/
# throwaway directory a developer made at the root — a data directory holds
# a board, a key store a key.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates
!clients
